Package: proxmox-easy-actions
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 8.4), init-system-helpers, libcryptx-perl, perl
Maintainer: Proxmox Easy Actions contributors
Description: Configurable guest actions for Proxmox VE
 Adds an Actions menu to the desktop UI for QEMU and LXC guests.
 Administrators can define and run ordered commands inside each guest, supply
 secrets to actions, and view results in the Proxmox VE task viewer.
